# Cloudflare static-asset upload filter (gitignore syntax).
#
# The asset directory is this repository ROOT, and unlike Pages, Cloudflare
# Workers does NOT automatically exclude .git. Without the entries below the
# build also publishes .git/ — ~300 MB of history that still holds the
# original, uncompressed video masters (59/47/41/30 MB). Any single file
# over 25 MiB aborts the deploy with "Asset too large".
#
# Official reference:
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/migrate-from-pages
#   "...you can create an .assetsignore file in your project's static asset
#    directory" -> **/node_modules  **/.DS_Store  **/.git

.git
**/.git
**/.git/**

**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
